        "message": "🏥 **{{CLINIC_NAME}} Appointment Reminder**\n\n📅 You have an appointment tomorrow at {{ $json.appointmentTime }}\n\n📍 Location: {{CLINIC_ADDRESS}}\n📞 Questions? Call {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}}\n\n⚠️ Please note our {{CANCELLATION_POLICY}} cancellation policy.\n\nSee you soon! 🐾",
