    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Appointment Management (PET WF2)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Streamlines appointment booking, confirmation, and reminder processes\n\n**🚀 Features:**\n• 📅 Automatic appointment logging from Calendly\n• 📧 Instant confirmation messages via SMS\n• ⏰ Automated reminder system (runs every {{REMINDER_CHECK_INTERVAL}} hours)\n• 📊 Central appointment tracking in Google Sheets\n• 🔄 Real-time status updates\n\n**📋 Process Flow:**\n1. **New Appointment:** Calendly webhook triggers instant logging\n2. **Confirmation:** Immediate SMS confirmation to customer\n3. **Daily Reminders:** Scheduled SMS reminders for next-day appointments\n4. **Master Tracking:** All appointments logged to central hub\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Address: {{CLINIC_ADDRESS}}\n• Phone: {{BUSINESS_PHONE_NUMBER}}\n• Email: {{BUSINESS_EMAIL}}\n• Timezone: {{TIMEZONE}}\n• Cancellation Policy: {{CANCELLATION_POLICY}}\n• Reminder Interval: {{REMINDER_CHECK_INTERVAL}} hours\n\n**📊 Sheet Integration:**\n• Appointments Sheet: {{APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}\n• Master Hub: {{MASTER_APPOINTMENTS_SHEET_ID}}",
